  "prefLabel": "Agr 103.07 Division of Pesticide Control",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 103.07 Division of Pesticide Control. The division of pesticide control shall ensure the safe and proper use of chemical pesticides by enforcing state pesticide laws affecting the sale, storage and application of all registered pesticides, examining and licensing pesticide dealers and users, and registering all economic poisons sold and used within the state.\n\nSource. #6012, eff 3-28-95",
